<p>Overall, I like this. I like it a lot.</p>
<p>It's got some very beautiful moments - the bit with the Plague Doctor at the beginning, for example. Or the 173 flashback - both are very simple, but precise and tense.</p>
<p>I personally don't mind 682's appearance here, ultimately - yes there's a degree of 'It's the lizard again', but it's fun to see the damn thing's intelligence being highlighted. I'd probably draw out the moment when the Knight realises what he's dealing with, though - it sounds like a weighty moment, when you realise you'll have to change your whole battle plan for a fight that's even more doomed than you already thought. But that might be just me.</p>

							</div>

								
					
